Australian Writing MCP
======================

This project includes work derived from Harper (https://github.com/Automattic/harper),
Copyright the Harper contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Derived components:

  * src/australian_writing/indefinite_article.py
      A Python port of Harper's `starts_with_vowel` logic
      (harper-core/src/indefinite_article.rs).

  * src/australian_writing/_phrase_data.py
      Phrase-correction data extracted from Harper's `phrase_set_corrections`
      rule set (harper-core/src/linting/phrase_set_corrections/mod.rs).
      Regenerate with tools/generate_phrase_data.py.

